    {
      "title": "INDIA bloc leaders to hold joint presser, Rahul to host tea for Oppn MPs",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/politics/rahul-gandhi-to-host-high-tea-for-oppn-mps-civil-society-members-today-126101300041_1.html",
      "description": "Leader of the Opposition in the Lok Sabha Rahul Gandhi has invited INDIA bloc MPs, civil society members and student organisations for a high tea at his residence on Tuesday, sources said.\nThey said a joint press conference of INDIA leaders would also take place in the afternoon followed by tea at Gandhi's 5, Sunehri Bagh Road residence.\n\"Following today's March for Democracy and the submission of the petition ... a joint press conference of INDIA leaders will be held tomorrow afternoon, followed by tea. 'I invite you to join me at my residence at 5, Sunehri Bagh Road, New Delhi, at 4:00 PM on Tuesday, 13th October',\" the invite read.\nThis comes a day after the raging protests over the vote theft charge reached the Supreme Court's doorstep. Opposition stalwarts, joined by activists and civil society members, undertook a \"March for Democracy\" on a heavily barricaded route and filed a joint petition against SIR and alleged poll irregularities in a major show of strength in the nationa",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-10-13T02:09:00"
    }
